arbon Steel / Stainless Steel (sesuai existing) Coating internal: Epoxy food grade / anti-corrosion Coating external: Anti karat + finishing paint 3.2. Pipa Material: Carbon Steel ASTM A106 / A53, atau HDPE / PVC (sesuai sistem eksisting) Tekanan kerja: sesuai desain sistem IPLR Ketebalan: minimal schedule 40 (untuk baja) 3.3. Valve Material body: Cast Iron / Carbon Steel / Stainless Steel Pressure rating: minimal PN10 / PN16 Standar: ANSI / JIS / DIN Dilengkapi: Handwheel / actuator (jika diperlukan) Nameplate dan arah aliran', 0, 'low', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3006552);
